---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Not a record: take records out of Archive. The emails are untouched and they are never filed again

Usage: mxr records dismiss [OPTIONS] <RECORD_ID>...

Arguments:
  <RECORD_ID>...

Options:
      --restore            Bring dismissed records back
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
